  - m_Id: 844345395
    m_Localized: Setting up navigation...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711691
  - m_Id: 844345396
    m_Localized: Imps are quick, nimble, and attack from range, but they are fragile
      and easy to defeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711692
  - m_Id: 844345397
    m_Localized: Don't confuse speed with haste, or the creatures in the labyrinths
      will catch you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711693
  - m_Id: 844345398
    m_Localized: Minotaurs are tougher than imps. Increase your power to defeat them
      in one hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711694
  - m_Id: 844345399
    m_Localized: Doom Slugs are tough and powerful, but slow. Keep your distance
      from these monstrosities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711695
  - m_Id: 844345400
    m_Localized: If your left thumb gets tired, you can keep playing with your right
      thumb. Open Options from the pause menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711696
  - m_Id: 844345401
    m_Localized: If you get lost, follow the right wall. It's a real technique, trust
      me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711697
  - m_Id: 844345402
    m_Localized: What has little horns, one big eye, and shoots laser beams? The
      imp!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711698
  - m_Id: 844345403
    m_Localized: What has big horns and red skin? The Minotaur!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711699
  - m_Id: 844345404
    m_Localized: What is gigantic, ugly, and has a tongue sticking out? The Doom
      Slug!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711700
  - m_Id: 844345405
    m_Localized: Yes, the exit is always at the end of the longest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6807400074399711701
  - m_Id: 844345406
